# Normalize line endings across platforms.
# Files are stored in the repository with LF and checked out with LF, so the
# working tree stays byte-identical whether this repo is opened on Linux, macOS
# or Windows. Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites
# every text file to CRLF and shows up as thousands of lines of phantom diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never text-normalized.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp  binary
*.tiff binary
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.mp4  binary
